  unitName: Xenon & Estia
  unitId: 850025
  unitNumber: 8024
  description: Ordered by the king of Elysia to evacuate before the gods descended
    upon the kingdom, Xenon armed himself with Trostan, the sword his foster father
    handed down to him, and took it upon himself to get the princess to safety. Estia,
    on the other hand, was thrilled at the chance to explore the lands beyond Elysia
    where she had the opportunity to put her magic to practical use.
  summonDesc: So you're the Summoner <br>everyone speaks of?<br>It is an honor to
    meet you!
  fusionDesc: Your help is much appreciated!<br>We'll make sure to honor you<br>when
    we rebuild Elysia!
